      },
      "body": "Under MultiConnector (e.g. [CPUOffload, MoRIIO]), a decode request can sideline MoRIIO on the load path → update_state_after_alloc is called with num_external_tokens == 0 and sent an empty block_notify_list. In write mode the producer rejects the empty notify and holds its deferred write-prefill blocks until timeout, exhausting the prefill pool under warm concurrency. Release those blocksand skip the notify instead.\r\n\r\n**Unti test added :**\r\n  tests/v1/kv_connector/unit/test_moriio_connector.py::test_write_mode_sidelined_by_multiconnector_releases_blocks_and_skips_notify\r\n\r\nTest fails without the fix, passes with it.",
